ed light, particularly mark zuckerberg.\n- some scenes feel a bit rushed, not giving full depth to certain relationships.\n\n**rating:** 4 out of 5 stars\n\n**recommendation:**\nif you are interested in the tech world, biographies, or just a well-made drama, \"the social network\" is definitely worth watching. however, keep in mind that the accuracy of some events has been questioned by the real individuals involved.", "logprobs": [{"token": "i", "logprob": -0.036448314785957336}, {"token": " recently", "logprob": -1.6012732982635498}, {"token": " watched", "logprob": -0.16032271087169647}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.31989991664886475}, {"token": " movie", "logprob": -0.00021491125517059118}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.00010907054820563644}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": " social", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": " network", "logprob": -2.50339189733495e-06}, {"token": "\"", "logprob": -0.003337054280564189}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.003698534332215786}, {"token": " here", "logprob": -0.07687067240476608}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.10103156417608261}, {"token": " my", "logprob": -0.0002615109842736274}, {"token": " detailed", "logprob": -2.3364747903542593e-05}, {"token": " review", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.0042700073681771755}, {"token": " all", "logprob": -0.0015312624163925648}, {"token": " lower", "logprob": -0.01417343970388174}, {"token": " case", "logprob": -2.9802276912960224e-06}, {"token": " as", "logprob": -0.10633276402950287}, {"token": " requested", "logprob": -0.0013265152228996158}, {"token": ":\n\n", "logprob": -0.01422479934990406}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.000502817565575242}, {"token": "movie", "logprob": -0.0016124354442581534}, {"token": " title", "logprob": -0.03764357790350914}, {"token": ":**", "logprob": -0.002643188228830695}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -4.410734163684538e-06}, {"token": " social", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token"